          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Friendly units within 12&quot; of a model equipped with the Chapter banner, and drawn from the same Chapter, re-roll failed Morale checks, Pinning tests, and Fear tests.  In addition, all friendly models with the same Space Marines Faction in the same unit as this banner have +1 Attack whilst the bearer is alive.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
