          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A model equipped with the Standard of the Emporer Ascendant has the Fear special rule. In addition, friendly models drawn form the same Chapter as a model equipped with the Standard of the Emporer Ascendant have +1 Attack and the Fearless special rule whilst they are within 12&quot; of that model.</characteristic>
