          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Wrath of the Heavens is a Space Marine bike.  When a model riding Wrath of the Heavens Turbo-boosts, it can move up to 18&quot; and pass over units and terrain as though it were a Jetbike.</characteristic>
