          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If Zhrukhal Androcles is an army&apos;s Warlord, he and his unit have the Feel No Pain special rule while within 3&quot; of an objective.</characteristic>
