        <rule name="Bane of Hatred" id="9595-6e56-8cec-7010" hidden="false" publicationId="7ab0-ceb9-pubN146351">
          <description>Both Ivanus Enkomi and any Space Marine squad with Chapter Tactics (Minotaurs) he joins, have the Rage special rule.</description>
