          <description>The Prometheus has the Night Vision special rule. In addition, the cover saves of enemy targets that it fires on are reduced by -1</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Improved Comms" id="63a1-c74b-56d5-87bf" hidden="false" publicationId="7ab0-ceb9-pubN169253">
          <description>The presence of one or more vehicles on the battlefield adds +1 to the result of the controlling player&apos;s Reserve rolls (note that this effect is not cumulative with other bonuses).</description>
