          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Units arriving by teleport (using Deep Strike) which are part of the force containing the Damocles, do not need to roll to scatter if they choose to arrive within 12&quot; of the Damocles.</characteristic>
